---
name: review-complete
version: 1.0.0
description: Reviewer completion report for a review-task; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - phase
  - branch
  - commit
  - verdict
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - findings_md
optional_variables:
  - notes_md
defaults:
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: review-complete
  tags:
    - stage:review
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: phase
      variable: phase
    state: review-complete
    stage: review
    transition: complete
---
# Review Complete

